Z||000011||Xtreme Fiero's||08-14-2000||08:34 AM||||The car has a Weapon R intake, Monster flow air filter, Holley TBI, Ported heads & intake, NOS Pro fogger system, DC sports race exhaust, lunati crank (.500 stroke), Trw pistons (.30 over), ARP bolts, accell coil, 10.8 Accell wires and a 86 SE computer w/ chip & sister unit. This setup won't pass emissions due to the exhaust system, If I spliced a cat in there I think it would pass.<P>The pills i'm using i had to buy seprate from the kit, I got thefrom Prostart performance her in frederck MD. he just handed the 4 pills to me & said "you know where they go right?" when i go back to pick up my car i'll see what size they are he keeps them in a fishing box looking thing from like 5hp up tp 1000hp. so i'll have to ask him. Are there diffrent size pills that are still 50 shot?||||reg||6
