Z||000018||Xtreme Fiero's||08-14-2000||02:47 PM|||| OGRE: we haven't found the piston yet  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> the head looks ok (It may be cracked) so it didn't go out the top. the owner of Prostart Performance here in fredrick thinks that the piston slid down the piston bore & was torn up by the crank there where LARGE chunks of what looks like piston and block in the oil pan. I hear that if this had happend while I was burning up the tire the rod may have come through the fire wall and hit me.||||reg||1
